246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (        Cardsafe is an advanced system designed to detect and prevent credit card fraud using machine learning. It identifies unusual patterns, such as unexpected transaction locations or high-value purchases, to spot potential fraud. The system uses supervised to improve accuracy and minimize false alarms. Real-time alerts notify users and banks about suspicious activity through multiple communication channels. Key techniques include decision trees, logistic regression and  random forests trained on real-world data. This system enhances security, reduces financial loss, and builds customer trust. Cardsafe offers a reliable, responsive solution for combating credit card fraud effectively.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
