249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (       Cardsafe is an intelligent system that detects credit card fraud by analyzing real-time transaction patterns using advanced machine learning. It identifies unusual activities, such as transactions from unexpected locations or large purchases, by comparing them with a user's historical data. Upon detecting suspicious behavior, the system sends instant alerts to users and banks for swift action. This proactive approach helps prevent fraud, reduces financial losses, and builds user trust. Cardsafe also continuously adapts to new fraud techniques, ensuring ongoing effectiveness and providing a safer credit card experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
